{{ site.app.name }} ({{ site.app.url }}) is a web app for ski tourers and
off-piste skiers in the Alps. It shows the avalanche bulletins published by
SLF (Switzerland), ALBINA / EUREGIO (Tyrol, South Tyrol, Trentino) and
Météo-France in full, on a map, alongside weather, routes and trips. This site
explains how it works and why it was built the way it was.

